{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a petty wizard in a small town. However, on the first day at your school, you step through its grand gates\u2014only to uncover an unexpected truth. What does this revelation mean? Where will your curiosity lead you? What mysteries lie hidden beyond the familiar halls of your new school?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449950/extras/Descriptions_Choose_GIF240.gif?t=1742374121\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Unravel the Truth Through Your Choices</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your life is not confined to classrooms. As you venture beyond its walls, you will witness strange events and meet all kinds of people. Along the way, countless choices await\u2014each decision shaping the fate of those around you. Choose wisely, for your actions will carve the path ahead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449950/extras/Descriptions_Explore_GIF240.gif?t=1742374121\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Grow Through Exploration and Battle</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The forest, the ocean, the mountain, and the snowland\u2014each region is home to creatures that thrive in their unique environments. Defeat monsters, gather valuable resources, and craft essential items. The materials you obtain can be sold for gold or used to unlock new skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449950/extras/Descriptions_Help_GIF240.gif?t=1742374121\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Help Those in Need</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The quest board near the school is filled with requests from villagers and fellow students. Lend them a hand, and you'll be rewarded handsomely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449950/extras/Descriptions_Craft_GIF240.gif?t=1742374121\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Craft, Discover, and Expand Your Knowledge</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine various materials to create new items and record your discoveries in the dictionary. Will you be able to collect and document every item hidden in the world?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449950/extras/Descriptions_Farm_GIF240.gif?t=1742374121\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Tend to Your Own Farm</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow crops and harvest them with care. Your bounty can be used to learn new skills and craft powerful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449950?t=1742374121","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449950?t=1742374121","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449950/e66fe30dbfc95e0521db7ba8fefe0f44d252d7c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742374121","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449950/e66fe30dbfc95e0521db7ba8fefe0f44d252d7c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742374121","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a petty wizard in a small town. However, on the first day at your school, you step through its grand gates\u2014only to uncover an unexpected truth. What does this revelation mean? Where will your curiosity lead you? What mysteries lie hidden beyond the familiar halls of your new school?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449950/extras/Descriptions_Choose_GIF240.gif?t=1742374121\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Unravel the Truth Through Your Choices</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your life is not confined to classrooms. As you venture beyond its walls, you will witness strange events and meet all kinds of people. Along the way, countless choices await\u2014each decision shaping the fate of those around you. Choose wisely, for your actions will carve the path ahead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449950/extras/Descriptions_Explore_GIF240.gif?t=1742374121\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Grow Through Exploration and Battle</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The forest, the ocean, the mountain, and the snowland\u2014each region is home to creatures that thrive in their unique environments. Defeat monsters, gather valuable resources, and craft essential items. The materials you obtain can be sold for gold or used to unlock new skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449950/extras/Descriptions_Help_GIF240.gif?t=1742374121\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Help Those in Need</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The quest board near the school is filled with requests from villagers and fellow students. Lend them a hand, and you'll be rewarded handsomely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449950/extras/Descriptions_Craft_GIF240.gif?t=1742374121\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Craft, Discover, and Expand Your Knowledge</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine various materials to create new items and record your discoveries in the dictionary. Will you be able to collect and document every item hidden in the world?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449950/extras/Descriptions_Farm_GIF240.gif?t=1742374121\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>Tend to Your Own Farm</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow crops and harvest them with care. Your bounty can be used to learn new skills and craft powerful items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul>","developers":["pettywizardtale"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449950/e4761a3056488285d12482247bfe59ad1118cb93/header.jpg?t=1742374121","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257102287,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257102287/movie480.mp4?t=1742374119","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257102287/movie_max.mp4?t=1742374119"},"name":"A Tale Of Petty Wizard Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257102287/c9d53eb039419a10118d2a756e1345b65ba3f07d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742374119","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257102287/movie480_vp9.webm